## tictactoe (both sides play random legal marks until a line or a draw ends the game) under
## the world conventions (the shared library, no external environment: ^environment none).

## Shared Soar library (Soar/soar-library, v2.32); the path assumes this folder is in Tasks/Families/<family>/world/<variant>
pushd "../../../../../Soar/soar-library"
source soar-library.soar
popd

chunk never
multi-attributes object 20
multi-attributes cell-handle 3

source tictactoe-world.soar
source tictactoe-operators.soar
source tictactoe-monitor.soar
